OL,3,GNEWSA'AI glasses give me independence
OL,4,Aas a blind farmer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the family of visually impaired
OL,7,Fchicken farmer Dave Cragg, his decision
OL,8,Fto buy AI-powered smart glasses for his
OL,9,F65th birthday delivered a magical
OL,10,Fmoment.
OL,12,F"It was the first birthday - and I am
OL,13,F33 - [that] I have ever seen my dad be
OL,14,Fable to read a birthday card," said his
OL,15,Feldest daughter Philippa Wilcox.
OL,17,FCragg, who began losing his sight aged
OL,18,F10 and now has very limited peripheral
OL,19,Fvision, had initially doubted what
OL,20,Fbenefit the glasses would bring. They
OL,21,Fhave also proven controversial amid
OL,22,Fconcerns about covert recording.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
