OL,3,GNEWSA'AI glasses give me independence
OL,4,Aas a blind farmer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the camera in the frames, which
OL,7,Flinks to apps on his phone, has enabled
OL,8,FCragg from Wybunbury, Cheshire, to
OL,9,Fbecome "a lot more independent" than he
OL,10,Fhad been in the past.
